<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .wrapper { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 40px 0; width: 100%; }
        .container { width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .header { background-color: #0d6efd; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .content { padding: 40px; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #0d6efd; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; margin-top: 20px; }
        .table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        .table th, .table td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6; text-align: left; }
        .table th { background-color: #f8f9fa; width: 30%; font-weight: 600; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <h2>ITSM SYSTEM</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                @RenderBody()
            </div>
            <div class="footer">
                본 메일은 시스템에 의해 자동으로 발송되었습니다.<br />
                © 2026 ITSM System. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
